    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="Arrakis" id="0">
      <data key="d10">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Arrakis, the planet known as Dune, is forever his place.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="Arrakis" id="1">
      <data key="d10">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">you'll be following tomorrow. Next time we meet it'll be on the soil of your new world.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="Caladan" id="0">
      <data key="d10">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">he was born on Caladan and lived his first fifteen years there.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="Caladan" id="1">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">I talk to her and tell her about you, about seeing the Reverend Mother on Caladan.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="Lady Jessica" id="0">
      <data key="d10">FAMILY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">an old crone came to visit the mother of the boy, Paul.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="Lady Jessica" id="1">
      <data key="d10">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">He stared at his mother as though she were a stranger.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="Duke Leto" id="0">
      <data key="d10">FAMILY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">mother of the ducal heir</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="dream" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Paul fell asleep to dream of an Arrakeen cavern</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="dream" id="1">
      <data key="d10">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Paul closed his eyes. "I dreamed a cavern . . . and water . . . and a girl there -- very skinny with big eyes.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="House of Atreides" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">It carried the red Atreides hawk crest above the breast pocket.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="duke" id="0">
      <data key="d10">FAMILY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">you dare suggest a duke's son is an animal?</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="test" id="0">
      <data key="d10">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Your mother survived this test. Now it's your turn.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="Litany against Fear" id="0">
      <data key="d10">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">he recalled the response from the Litany against Fear as his mother had taught him</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="test with the gom jabbar" id="0">
      <data key="d10">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">He jerked his hand from the box, stared at it astonished.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="old woman" id="0">
      <data key="d10">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">He dropped the hand to his side, looked at the old woman.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="Butlerian Jihad" id="0">
      <data key="d10">QUOTED</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Paul quoted. "Right out of the Butlerian Jihad</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="Orange Catholic Bible" id="0">
      <data key="d10">QUOTED</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Paul quoted. "Right out of the Butlerian Jihad and the Orange Catholic Bible</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="Orange Catholic Bible" id="1">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">"It's a very old Orange Catholic Bible made for space travelers."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="Harkonnens" id="0">
      <data key="d10">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">To attempt an understanding of Muad'Dib without understanding his mortal enemies, the Harkonnens</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="Reverend Mother" id="0">
      <data key="d10">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Wariness veiled his eyes when he glanced at the Reverend Mother, but this time he nodded to her, the nod one gives an equal.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="poem" id="0">
      <data key="d10">CREATED</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">And I tell her the poem, but I have to explain some of the words -- like beach and surf and seaweed and seagulls.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="his father" id="0">
      <data key="d10">FAMILY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">You talk as though my father were dead.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="EVENT" id="0">
      <data key="d10">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">Hawat pulled up a chair across from Paul, sat down facing the door.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="Thufir Hawat" id="0">
      <data key="d10">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Hawat looked at the boy. "I was thinking we'll all be out of here soon and likely never see the place again."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="FAMILY" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">"Did my father send you up to test me?"</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="Mother" id="0">
      <data key="d10">FAMILY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">he'd already been warned -- by you, by Mother</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="Duncan" id="0">
      <data key="d10">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">How'd she figure your father attracted men like Duncan and Gurney?</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="Gurney Halleck" id="0">
      <data key="d10">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">How'd she figure your father attracted men like Duncan and Gurney?</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="Gurney Halleck" id="1">
      <data key="d10">FRIENDS_WITH</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Of all his father's men, he liked Gurney Halleck best, knew the man's moods and deviltry, his humors, and thought of him more as a friend than as a hired sword.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="Dr. Wellington Yueh" id="0">
      <data key="d10">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">that's what Dr. Yueh calls the Mystery of Life.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="Paul's father" id="0">
      <data key="d10">FAMILY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">I tell you only as your father's helper.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="Halleck" id="0">
      <data key="d10">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Paul stepped back, chagrined.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="Halleck" id="1">
      <data key="d10">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.7</data>
      <data key="d12">Is this betrayal? Paul wondered. Surely not Gurney!</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="training fight" id="0">
      <data key="d10">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Paul activated his shield, parried and countered.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="crossing to Arrakis" id="0">
      <data key="d10">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">crossing to Arrakis</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="study about the sandworms" id="0">
      <data key="d10">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">"I'd like to study more about the sandworms."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Paul Atreides" target="conical projection chart" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Paul glanced down at a conical projection chart of the northern Arrakeen latitudes spread on the table.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Arrakis" target="Dune" id="0">
      <data key="d10">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Arrakis -- Dune -- Desert Planet</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Arrakis" target="Empire" id="0">
      <data key="d10">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">"Arrakis! Truly unique. A superb setting for a unique Victory."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Arrakis" target="EVENT" id="0">
      <data key="d10">LOCATION</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Is it really that terrible, this planet of Arrakis?</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Arrakis" target="EVENT" id="1">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">It struck him as an odd place suddenly, a stranger-place with most of its hardware already gone off to Arrakis.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Arrakis" target="wilderness" id="0">
      <data key="d10">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">the wilderness that is empty, the wasteland where nothing lives except the spice and the sandworms</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Arrakis" target="northern latitudes" id="0">
      <data key="d10">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">"It was taken in the northern latitudes."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lady Jessica" target="Bene Gesserit" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">a Bene Gesserit Lady</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lady Jessica" target="Bene Gesserit" id="1">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Damn that Jessica! the Reverend Mother thought. If only she'd borne us a girl as she was ordered to do!</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lady Jessica" target="Duke Leto" id="0">
      <data key="d10">LOVES</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">a duke's concubine</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lady Jessica" target="Paul Atreides" id="0">
      <data key="d10">FAMILY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Jessica's hand went to Paul's shoulder, tightened there.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lady Jessica" target="Paul Atreides" id="1">
      <data key="d10">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">"Paul," Jessica said.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lady Jessica" target="Paul Atreides" id="2">
      <data key="d10">TRAINED</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">"You've been training him in the Way -- I've seen the signs of it."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lady Jessica" target="Reverend Mother" id="0">
      <data key="d10">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">The Lady Jessica was my serving wench, lad, for fourteen years at school.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lady Jessica" target="Reverend Mother" id="1">
      <data key="d10">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">The Reverend Mother looked at Jessica.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lady Jessica" target="old woman" id="0">
      <data key="d10">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">"The Lady Jessica was my serving wench, lad, for fourteen years at school."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lady Jessica" target="old woman" id="1">
      <data key="d10">HATES</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">"Jessica, have you ever stopped hating me?" the old woman asked.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lady Jessica" target="old woman" id="2">
      <data key="d10">LOVES</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">"I both love and hate you," Jessica said.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lady Jessica" target="test" id="0">
      <data key="d10">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Your mother survived this test.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lady Jessica" target="House of Atreides" id="0">
      <data key="d10">FAMILY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">You were told to bear only daughters to the Atreides.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lady Jessica" target="son" id="0">
      <data key="d10">FAMILY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">the life of your son.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lady Jessica" target="her son" id="0">
      <data key="d10">FAMILY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">"And your son will pay with you."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lady Jessica" target="A Child's History of Muad'Dib" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">the Lady Jessica, who guided her son in the Bene Gesserit Way,</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lady Jessica" target="EVENT" id="0">
      <data key="d10">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">they sent the old Proctor here -- to whip our dear Lady Jessica into line.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="House of Atreides" target="Castle Caladan" id="0">
      <data key="d10">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Castle Caladan, and the ancient pile of stone that had served the Atreides family as home for twenty-six generations</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="House of Atreides" target="Paul Atreides" id="0">
      <data key="d10">FAMILY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">the Atreides family as home for twenty-six generations</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="House of Atreides" target="Arrakis" id="0">
      <data key="d10">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Now the Harkonnens were leaving to be replaced by the House of Atreides in fief-complete</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="House of Atreides" target="Arrakis" id="1">
      <data key="d10">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">"I indicate that House Atreides will go to Arrakis."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="House of Atreides" target="Harkonnens" id="0">
      <data key="d10">REPLACES</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">the Harkonnens were leaving to be replaced by the House of Atreides</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="House of Atreides" target="farmlands" id="0">
      <data key="d10">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">the green farmlands of the Atreides family holding</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bene Gesserit" target="Book 1 DUNE" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">This every sister of the Bene Gesserit knows.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bene Gesserit" target="people" id="0">
      <data key="d10">SIFT</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">"We Bene Gesserit sift people to find the humans."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bene Gesserit" target="schools" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">"Bene Gesserit schools?" She nodded.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bene Gesserit" target="Politics" id="0">
      <data key="d10">PERFORMS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Bene Gesserit performs another function." "Politics," he said.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Duke Leto" target="Federated Great Houses of the Landsraad" id="0">
      <data key="d10">POPULAR_AMONG</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">for the Duke Leto was popular among the Great Houses of the Landsraad</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Duke Leto" target="Arrakis" id="0">
      <data key="d10">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">He signs it: 'Duke Leto of Arrakis.'</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Duke Leto" target="House of Atreides" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">"our campaign against the House of Atreides."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Duke Leto" target="House of Atreides" id="1">
      <data key="d10">FAMILY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">the Duke and his family</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Duke Leto" target="Residency" id="0">
      <data key="d10">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">the Duke and his family will occupy the Residency</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Duke Leto" target="Fremen" id="0">
      <data key="d10">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.7</data>
      <data key="d12">The Duke Leto," Piter said, "may attempt to flee to the new Fremen scum along the desert's edge.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Duke Leto" target="his son" id="0">
      <data key="d10">FAMILY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">this chip here, this is the Duke Leto, and this one's his son</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Duke Leto" target="A Child's History of Muad'Dib" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">the Duke Leto, whose qualities as a father have long been overlooked.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Thufir Hawat" target="Duke Leto" id="0">
      <data key="d10">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Thufir Hawat, his father's Master of Assassins</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Thufir Hawat" target="Mentat" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">"I've studied with Thufir Hawat."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Thufir Hawat" target="Paul Atreides" id="0">
      <data key="d10">FRIENDS_WITH</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">There was Thufir Hawat, the old Mentat Master of Assassins, who struck fear even into the heart of the Padishah Emperor.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Thufir Hawat" target="Paul Atreides" id="1">
      <data key="d10">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Hawat pulled up a chair across from Paul, sat down facing the door.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Thufir Hawat" target="Paul Atreides" id="2">
      <data key="d10">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">noting that Hawat's men already had been over it, checking, making it safe for a duke's heir.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Thufir Hawat" target="A Child's History of Muad'Dib" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">was Thufir Hawat, the old Mentat Master of Assassins, who struck fear even into the heart of the Padishah Emperor.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Thufir Hawat" target="Castle Caladan" id="0">
      <data key="d10">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Thufir Hawat slipped into the training room of Castle Caladan, closed the door softly.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Thufir Hawat" target="EVENT" id="0">
      <data key="d10">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">Hawat pulled up a chair across from Paul, sat down facing the door.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Thufir Hawat" target="Paul's father" id="0">
      <data key="d10">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">"Did my father send you up to test me?" Hawat scowled -- the boy had such observing ways about him. He nodded.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Thufir Hawat" target="passage" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Hawat thought</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Thufir Hawat" target="Reverend Mother" id="0">
      <data key="d10">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">"Did you meet the Reverend Mother?" "That Truthsayer witch from the Imperium?" Hawat's eyes quickened with interest. "I met her."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Thufir Hawat" target="Arrakis" id="0">
      <data key="d10">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Hawat stood up. "I leave today for Arrakis.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Harkonnens" target="House of Atreides" id="0">
      <data key="d10">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">their mortal enemies, the Harkonnens</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Harkonnens" target="Arrakis" id="0">
      <data key="d10">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">the Harkonnens, had been on Arrakis eighty years</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Harkonnens" target="Arrakis" id="1">
      <data key="d10">LEAVES</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">the Harkonnens were leaving to be replaced by the House of Atreides</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CHOAM Company" target="Arrakis" id="0">
      <data key="d10">OWNS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">under a CHOAM Company contract to mine the geriatric spice</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CHOAM Company" target="Imperium" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">CHOAM was the key to wealth, each noble House dipping from the company's coffers whatever it could under the power of the directorships.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CHOAM Company" target="passage" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">The Imperium, the CHOAM Company, all the Great Houses, they are but bits of flotsam in the path of the flood.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CHOAM Company" target="path of the flood." id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
