    </edge>
    <edge source="Dr. Wellington Yueh" target="Paul Atreides" id="0">
      <data key="d10">TEACHES</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Dr. Yueh, his teacher, had hinted</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Dr. Wellington Yueh" target="Paul Atreides" id="1">
      <data key="d10">FRIENDS_WITH</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">Dr. Wellington Yueh, a name</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Dr. Wellington Yueh" target="Paul Atreides" id="2">
      <data key="d10">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Paul joined him at the table, buttoning his jacket.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Dr. Wellington Yueh" target="end of all the Atreides" id="0">
      <data key="d10">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Dr. Yueh will move against him soon, and that'll be the end of all the Atreides.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Dr. Wellington Yueh" target="Baron Vladimir Harkonnen" id="0">
      <data key="d10">AGENT_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">The obvious suspect is Dr. Yueh, who is indeed our agent.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Dr. Wellington Yueh" target="Suk School" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">our doctor is a Suk School graduate</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Dr. Wellington Yueh" target="Imperial Conditioning" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">our doctor is a Suk School graduate with Imperial Conditioning</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Dr. Wellington Yueh" target="A Child's History of Muad'Dib" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Dr. Wellington Yueh, a name black in treachery but bright in knowledge;</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Dr. Wellington Yueh" target="investigation" id="0">
      <data key="d10">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">I must seek out the planetary ecologist when we arrive -- a Dr. Kynes -- and offer my help in the investigation.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Dr. Wellington Yueh" target="Orange Catholic Bible" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">"It's a very old Orange Catholic Bible made for space travelers."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Dr. Wellington Yueh" target="filmbook" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">"I've a filmbook on a small specimen, only one hundred and ten meters long and twenty-two meters in diameter."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Dr. Wellington Yueh" target="gift" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">"Before I go, I've a gift for you, something I came across in packing."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Dr. Wellington Yueh" target="Wanna Marcus" id="0">
      <data key="d10">FAMILY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">my Wanna's favorite passage</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Fremen" target="Arrakis" id="0">
      <data key="d10">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">the planet sheltered people who lived at the desert edge without caid or bashar to command them: will-o'-the-sand people called Fremen</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Fremen" target="passage" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Have you ever seen the Fremen?</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Fremen" target="Harkonnens" id="0">
      <data key="d10">HATES</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">they hate Harkonnens with a bloody passion.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Fremen" target="desert" id="0">
      <data key="d10">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">The Fremen must be brave to live at the edge of that desert.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Fremen" target="poems" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">They compose poems to their knives.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Reverend Mother" target="Emperor" id="0">
      <data key="d10">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Now, she's the Emperor's Truthsayer.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Reverend Mother" target="Paul's dreams" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">"I dreamed of her once," Paul said.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Reverend Mother" target="Lady Jessica" id="0">
      <data key="d10">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">The Lady Jessica was my serving wench, lad, for fourteen years at school.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Reverend Mother" target="Lady Jessica" id="1">
      <data key="d10">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">The old voice carried a tone of cruel mimicry.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Reverend Mother" target="Butlerian Jihad" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Right out of the Butlerian Jihad and the Orange Catholic Bible," she said.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Reverend Mother" target="Orange Catholic Bible" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Right out of the Butlerian Jihad and the Orange Catholic Bible," she said.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Reverend Mother" target="Bene Gesserit" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">The Reverend Mother returned her attention to Paul.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Reverend Mother" target="Bene Gesserit" id="1">
      <data key="d10">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">The old woman stared at Paul, then: "Young man, as a Proctor of the Bene Gesserit, I seek the Kwisatz Haderach, the male who truly can become one of us.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Reverend Mother" target="Paul Atreides" id="0">
      <data key="d10">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">The Reverend Mother stared at him, wondering: Did I hear criticism in his voice?</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Reverend Mother" target="Kwisatz Haderach" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Don't you want to hear what the Reverend Mother can tell you about the Kwisatz Haderach?</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Reverend Mother" target="passage" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">the ordeal with the Reverend Mother</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Reverend Mother" target="Imperium" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">"That Truthsayer witch from the Imperium?"</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Emperor" target="his friends" id="0">
      <data key="d10">FRIENDS_WITH</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">The Emperor and his friends now command fifty-nine point six-five per cent of the CHOAM directorship's votes.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Emperor" target="fifty-nine point six-five per cent of the CHOAM directorship's votes" id="0">
      <data key="d10">OWNS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">The Emperor and his friends now command fifty-nine point six-five per cent of the CHOAM directorship's votes.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Emperor" target="Paul Atreides" id="0">
      <data key="d10">ORDERS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Because the Emperor ordered it.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Reverend Mother Gaius Helen Mohiam" target="Bene Gesserit" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">a mission that required personal attention from a Bene Gesserit-with-theSight.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Reverend Mother Gaius Helen Mohiam" target="Padishah Emperor's Truthsayer" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Even the Padishah Emperor's Truthsayer couldn't evade that responsibility</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Reverend Mother Gaius Helen Mohiam" target="Bene Gesserit school" id="0">
      <data key="d10">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Reverend Mother Gaius Helen Mohiam, Proctor Superior of the Bene Gesserit school</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="old woman" target="Paul Atreides" id="0">
      <data key="d10">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.7</data>
      <data key="d12">Withdraw your hand and the gom jabbar takes you.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="old woman" target="test with the gom jabbar" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">The old woman muttered. "Kull wahad! No woman child ever withstood that much."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="gom jabbar" target="Paul Atreides" id="0">
      <data key="d10">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">"The gom jabbar, the highhanded enemy. It's a needle with a drop of poison on its tip."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="gom jabbar" target="test with the gom jabbar" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">She leaned back, withdrawing the gom jabbar from the side of his neck.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Spacing Guild" target="schools" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">the Bene Gesserit and the Spacing Guild. The Guild, so we think, emphasizes almost pure mathematics.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Spacing Guild" target="monopoly on interstellar transport" id="0">
      <data key="d10">OWNS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">the Guild with its damnable monopoly on interstellar transport.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Truthsayer drug" target="passage" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Now, lad, do you know about the Truthsayer drug?</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Kwisatz Haderach" target="passage" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">You say maybe I'm the . . . Kwisatz Haderach.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Baron Vladimir Harkonnen" target="Piter de Vries" id="0">
      <data key="d10">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">There it is, Piter -- the biggest mantrap in all history. And the Duke's headed into its jaws. Is it not a magnificent thing that I, the Baron Vladimir Harkonnen, do?</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Baron Vladimir Harkonnen" target="Piter de Vries" id="1">
      <data key="d10">HATES</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">I must do away with that one soon. He has almost outlived his usefulness.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Baron Vladimir Harkonnen" target="Piter de Vries" id="2">
      <data key="d10">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">My uncle cannot talk to his Mental without arguing.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Baron Vladimir Harkonnen" target="Feyd-Rautha Harkonnen" id="0">
      <data key="d10">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">"Observe closely, Piter, and you, too, FeydRautha, my darling"</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Baron Vladimir Harkonnen" target="Feyd-Rautha Harkonnen" id="1">
      <data key="d10">FAMILY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">"it is not necessary to confuse my nephew."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Baron Vladimir Harkonnen" target="Feyd-Rautha Harkonnen" id="2">
      <data key="d10">LOVES</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">Send for food, my darling.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Baron Vladimir Harkonnen" target="Duke Leto" id="0">
      <data key="d10">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">"the Padishah Emperor believes he's given the Duke your spice planet."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Baron Vladimir Harkonnen" target="Duke Leto" id="1">
      <data key="d10">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">the Duke will know, too. He knows now.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Baron Vladimir Harkonnen" target="Duke Leto" id="2">
      <data key="d10">HATES</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">Loveliest of all," Piter said, "is that the Duke will know, too.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Baron Vladimir Harkonnen" target="Leto Atreides" id="0">
      <data key="d10">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">"I have ofttimes met your treachery and this all men know."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Baron Vladimir Harkonnen" target="Emperor" id="0">
      <data key="d10">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">Already you have the Emperor's eyes on you, Baron.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Baron Vladimir Harkonnen" target="Corps of Sardaukar" id="0">
      <data key="d10">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">You'd enjoy seeing the Corps of Sardaukar pillage through my cities and sack this castle.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Baron Vladimir Harkonnen" target="Lady Jessica" id="0">
      <data key="d10">PROMISED</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">You promised me the Lady Jessica. You promised her to me.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Baron Vladimir Harkonnen" target="Lady Jessica" id="1">
      <data key="d10">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">with that witch mother training him. Accursed woman!</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Baron Vladimir Harkonnen" target="Paul Atreides" id="0">
      <data key="d10">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">What of the Dukeling, the child Paul, my dear Piter?</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Baron Vladimir Harkonnen" target="Mentat" id="0">
      <data key="d10">OWNS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">"This is a Mentat, Feyd. It has been trained and conditioned to perform certain duties."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Baron Vladimir Harkonnen" target="Thufir Hawat" id="0">
      <data key="d10">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Hawat's mind will be so filled with this prospect it'll impair his function as a Mentat.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Baron Vladimir Harkonnen" target="dispensation of that fief" id="0">
      <data key="d10">WILL_HAVE</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Your uncle will have dispensation of that fief.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Baron Vladimir Harkonnen" target="House of Atreides" id="0">
      <data key="d10">DESTROYED</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">the Baron has destroyed the Atreides</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Baron Vladimir Harkonnen" target="Arrakis" id="0">
      <data key="d10">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">The Baron moved out and away from the globe of Arrakis.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Piter de Vries" target="Baron Vladimir Harkonnen" id="0">
      <data key="d10">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">For a Mentat, you talk too much, Piter," the Baron said.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Piter de Vries" target="Baron Vladimir Harkonnen" id="1">
      <data key="d10">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">I know as a Mentat when you will send the executioner.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Piter de Vries" target="Arrakeen" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.7</data>
      <data key="d12">He might've come directly from the Arrakeen labor pool.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Feyd-Rautha Harkonnen" target="Baron Vladimir Harkonnen" id="0">
      <data key="d10">FAMILY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">"Yes, Uncle."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Corps of Sardaukar" target="Emperor" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">the Emperor will send a legion or two of his Sardaukar</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Corps of Sardaukar" target="end to the Baron Vladimir Harkonnen" id="0">
      <data key="d10">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">that'll be an end to the Baron Vladimir Harkonnen.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Giedi Prime" target="Baron Vladimir Harkonnen" id="0">
      <data key="d10">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">Sardaukar down here onto Giedi Prime</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Arrakeen" target="Arrakis" id="0">
      <data key="d10">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">"The Guild will deposit them at the city of Arrakeen rather than at our city of Carthag."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Count Fenring" target="Residency" id="0">
      <data key="d10">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">lately the home of Count and Lady Fenring</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Count Fenring" target="Ambassador to the Smugglers" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">He calls Count Fenring Ambassador to the Smugglers</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="House Harkonnen" target="Imperial House" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">since House Harkonnen is being used to do the Imperial dirty work</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="House Harkonnen" target="CHOAM Company" id="0">
      <data key="d10">OWNS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">we'll have an irrevocable directorship in the CHOAM Company</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="House Harkonnen" target="subfief on Arrakis" id="0">
      <data key="d10">WILL_HAVE</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">House Harkonnen will have a subfief on Arrakis within a Standard year.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Kynes" target="His Majesty" id="0">
      <data key="d10">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">that path is blocked by one of His Majesty's agents -- the planetary ecologist. You may remember him -- Kynes.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="St. Alia-of-the-Knife" target="Muad'Dib, Family Commentaries" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">-from "Muad'Dib, Family Commentaries" by the Princess Irulan</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Princess Irulan" target="Muad'Dib, Family Commentaries" id="0">
      <data key="d10">CREATED</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">-from "Muad'Dib, Family Commentaries" by the Princess Irulan</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bene Gesserit school" target="Wallach IX" id="0">
      <data key="d10">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Bene Gesserit school on Wallach IX</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Imperial Household" target="Federated Great Houses of the Landsraad" id="0">
      <data key="d10">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">We've a three-point civilization: the Imperial Household balanced against the Federated Great Houses of the Landsraad</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Missionaria Protectiva" target="EVENT" id="0">
      <data key="d10">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">The Missionaria Protectiva has been in there and softened it up somewhat.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Gurney Halleck" target="tone poems" id="0">
      <data key="d10">CREATED</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">It's just one of Gurney Halleck's tone poems for sad times.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Gurney Halleck" target="Paul Atreides" id="0">
      <data key="d10">FRIENDS_WITH</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">Muad'Dib did have wonderful companion-teachers. There was Gurney Halleck, the troubadour-warrior.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Gurney Halleck" target="Paul Atreides" id="1">
      <data key="d10">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">"are you the new weapons master?"</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Gurney Halleck" target="Paul Atreides" id="2">
      <data key="d10">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Of all his father's men, he liked Gurney Halleck best, knew the man's moods and deviltry, his humors, and thought of him more as a friend than as a hired sword.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Gurney Halleck" target="council" id="0">
      <data key="d10">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.7</data>
      <data key="d12">it was decided in council that you being such a poor fighter we'd best teach you the music trade</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Gurney Halleck" target="Duke Leto" id="0">
      <data key="d10">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">As to your father -the Duke'd punish me only if I failed to make a first-class fighting man out of you.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Duncan Idaho" target="Paul Atreides" id="0">
      <data key="d10">FRIENDS_WITH</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">There were Duncan Idaho, the Swordmaster of the Ginaz;</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Duncan Idaho" target="A Child's History of Muad'Dib" id="0">
      <data key="d10">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">There were Duncan Idaho, the Swordmaster of the Ginaz;</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Duncan Idaho" target="second wave onto Arrakis" id="0">
      <data key="d10">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Duncan's gone to lead the second wave onto Arrakis</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Proctor" target="EVENT" id="0">
      <data key="d10">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">they sent the old Proctor here -- to whip our dear Lady Jessica into line.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Halleck" target="Paul Atreides" id="0">
      <data key="d10">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">Halleck watched the action, turned at the last minute to let the blunted blade pass his chest.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Halleck" target="Paul Atreides" id="1">
      <data key="d10">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.7</data>
      <data key="d12">This in the hand of an enemy can let out your life's blood!</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Halleck" target="Beast Rabban" id="0">
      <data key="d10">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">how it had been put there by Beast Rabban in a Harkonnen slave pit on Giedi Prime</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Halleck" target="Harkonnen slave pit" id="0">
      <data key="d10">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">how it had been put there by Beast Rabban in a Harkonnen slave pit on Giedi Prime</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Halleck" target="Giedi Prime" id="0">
      <data key="d10">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">how it had been put there by Beast Rabban in a Harkonnen slave pit on Giedi Prime</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Halleck" target="younger sister" id="0">
      <data key="d10">FAMILY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
      <data key="d12">For some reason, he recalled his younger sister, her elfin face so clear in his mind.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="younger sister" target="pansies" id="0">
      <data key="d10">LOVES</data>
      <data key="d11">0.7</data>
      <data key="d12">She had loved pansies . . . or was it daisies?</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Harkonnen troops" target="younger sister" id="0">
      <data key="d10">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d11">0.9</data>
